---
title: "Wizard Finish: one atomic list"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Finish shown
  s1: Finishing
  s2: Failed, says why, Retry shown
  s3: Wizard gone, Close tab shown
  s4: No build for this device, says where to finish
  s5: Done, object opens
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: presses Finish or Retry
  s1 --> s0: tab reloads
  s1 --> s2: a write fails, list discarded
  s1 --> s4: the plugin has no build for this device
  s0 --> s3: list commits, or is refused as gone or reply lost, ending read or a list from before a reload ends
  s2 --> s0: tab reloads
  s2 --> s1: presses Finish or Retry
  s4 --> s0: tab reloads
  s2 --> s3: list commits, or is refused as gone or reply lost, ending read or a list from before a reload ends
  s1 --> s3: tab reloads or a write fails, list discarded or the plugin has no build for this device
  s1 --> s5: list refused, ending names the object
  s4 --> s3: list commits, or is refused as gone or reply lost, ending read or a list from before a reload ends
  s5 --> s3: tab reloads
